# A CRLF checkout breaks two of the checks CONTRIBUTING.md documents, and both
# fail invisibly: gofmt rewrites the line endings, so `golangci-lint fmt --diff`
# reports every Go file as unformatted, and `go mod tidy -diff` reports go.sum
# the same way — each printing a patch in which no line appears to change. `*`
# rather than `*.go` is for the second. Without this, whether a clone passes
# depends on a local git setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
